    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32624" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκπέτομαι</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκπετ-πέταμαι</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Arist.
			<u>HA</u>
			554b1
		</span></i>), fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-πτήσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>V.</u>
					208
				</span></i>
			 : aor.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξεπτόμην,</span>
			part.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-πτόμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Av.</u>
					788
				</span></i>
			 ; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξεπτάμην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>El.</u>
					944
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				81e
			</span></i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκπτάμενος Ἀθηνᾶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					20.249
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Chios</span>) : also in act. form 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξέπτην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Op.</u>
					98
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Batr.
				211
			</span></i>, Ant. <i><span class="en">
				Lib.
				1.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Palaeph.
				12
			</span></i> : for aor.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξεπετάσθην,</span>
			
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέτομαι</span>
			 :—<i>fly out</i> or <i>away,</i> ll. cc. : metaph.,
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔπαινοι Ἔρωσι μικροῖς ἐοικότες
					ἐκπετόμενοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Rh.Pr.</u>
					6
				</span></i>
			.</div>
